          "type": "added",
          "new_line": 33,
          "content": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "added",
          "new_line": 34,
          "content": "npm is useful for a local CLI, but GitHub Actions is the native integration point for a push-triggered CI/CD scanner. The target repository only needs a small workflow file while the scanner implementation stays centralized."
        },
